"900.3.10(809)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 809 keeps the lot frontage and lot area that existed when By-law 569-2013 was enacted, sets 0.9 m side and 3.0 m flanking-street setbacks, a 0.3 m attached garage side setback, a 6.0 m setback for a garage entrance facing the street, requires the parking space inside the residential building, and incorporates exception 900.3.10(1462).","code_refs":"none"}
